# Defaults for `npm run build` / `npm start` (NODE_ENV=production). Committed — no secrets here.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL is intentionally NOT set here: it's inlined into the browser bundle
# at build time, so it must come from the environment that runs `next build`:
#   - CI / hosting provider: set it as a build-time environment variable
#   - Docker: docker build --build-arg NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com .
#   - Manual build: put it in .env.production.local (git-ignored)
# The build fails with a clear error if it's missing.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
